  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Heat a large saucepan over high heat with the boiled water and a pinch of salt.\n• Cook fusilli in the boiling water until ‘al dente’, 12 minutes. Reserve some pasta water (1/3 cup for 2 people / 2/3 cup for 4 people).\n• Drain and return pasta to saucepan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-652ccfe39014a94c710fba02-ce0512ae.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate zucchini. Finely chop garlic.\n• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook sliced mushrooms, stirring, until browned and softened, 6-8 minutes.\n• Add garlic, garlic & herb seasoning and zucchini and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Little cooks: Under adult supervision, older kids can help grate the zucchini.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-652ccfe39014a94c710fba02-148b281e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium and add thickened cream, vegetable stock powder and the reserved pasta water, then simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add basil pesto, fusilli and baby spinach leaves. Stir to combine and season to taste. TIP: Add a splash more water if the sauce looks too thick. Serve the sauce on top of cooked pasta if preferred.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-652ccfe39014a94c710fba02-b20b788b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide fusilli between bowls. Top with creamy zucchini and mushroom sauce.\n• Sprinkle over Parmesan to serve. Enjoy! Little cooks: Add the finishing touch by sprinkling over the Parmesan!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-652ccfe39014a94c710fba02-0cc83271.jpeg"
    }
  ]
